flowchart TD
  A[Webhook or manual trigger] --> B[Validate payload]
  B --> C{Valid?}
  C -- No --> D[Incident log: validation error]
  C -- Yes --> E[Build idempotency key]
  E --> F{Already processed?}
  F -- Yes --> G[Return duplicate-safe response]
  F -- No --> H[Process operation]
  H --> I{API or downstream failure?}
  I -- Retryable --> J[Retry queue]
  J --> K[Replay after delay]
  K --> H
  I -- Permanent --> L[Incident log and alert]
  I -- No --> M[Mark processed]
  D --> N[Operator review]
  L --> N
  M --> O[Success response]

